{"id":"wb-6-498","name":"中前所城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中前所城","text":"中前所城位于中国辽宁省葫芦岛市绥中县前所镇，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n中前千户所隶属广宁前屯卫，所城始建于明宣德三年（1428年），清乾隆四十年（1755年）重修。所城占地27.5万平方米，大致呈方形，东西528米，南北521米，东、西、南三面辟门，门外设瓮城。城墙高7～8米，基宽6.5米，顶宽4.2米。城内古建筑已基本不存，城墙尚基本保持原貌。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%89%8D%E6%89%80%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":84934219,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84934219","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8afeccb068fa413dda2c632b.jpg","title":"Suizhong,_Huludao,_Liaoning,_China_-_panoramio_-_Matthew_Summerton_(36).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Suizhong,_Huludao,_Liaoning,_China_-_panoramio_-_Matthew_Summerton_(36).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Suizhong%2C_Huludao%2C_Liaoning%2C_China_-_panoramio_-_Matthew_Summerton_%2836%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Matthew Summerton","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Suizhong, Huludao, Liaoning, China","width":320,"height":428}}